---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Sidebar from '../../../components/Sidebar.astro';
---

<Layout title="Innovation" lang="en" activePage="innovation" altLangHref="/innovatie/">
  <div class="page-intro">
    <h1>Innovation</h1>
    <div class="intro-images">
      <img src="/images/ovens-bakkerij.jpg" alt="Bakery ovens" />
      <img src="/images/belshaw-afbakoven.jpg" alt="Belshaw bake off oven" />
      <img src="/images/image005-1.jpg" alt="Bakery equipment" />
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="content-area">
    <main class="main-content entry anim-up">
      <div class="breadcrumbs">
        <a href="/en/">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span><span>Innovation</span>
      </div>

      <div class="colored-box">
        <p style="text-align:justify;">Innovation represents a thorough renewal. Flavor, color and structure — modifying an existing food product or choosing a new product or an innovative packaging. All these things can help you to increase sales. To integrate successfully those kind of modifications, the experience one has are very important. Pinso is recognising better than anyone the problems and helps you finding the proper solution. We have a wide experience within the food industry. Thanks to our external partners we can provide useful advice in the industry of clothing and storage.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr; gap:20px; margin-top:14px;">
        <div>
          <h5>A PRODUCTION WITHIN THE BAKERY INDUSTRY</h5>
          <img src="/images/image002-3.jpg" alt="Bakery production" class="shadow-img" style="float:right; margin:0 0 10px 14px; width:180px; height:120px; object-fit:cover;" />
          <p style="text-align:justify;">Handicraft products, produced on an industrial line. French bread products based on sourdough (Levain). Quiches and related products for retail or service stations, anything what you can invent...</p>
          <p>We help you with the right recipe, to do the fine tuning of your production and providing a training of your employees, so that the introduction will be a success.</p>

          <div class="divider"></div>

          <h5>FAST FOOD CONCEPTS, FRANCHISE CONCEPTS AND FOOD EXPRESS</h5>
          <img src="/images/ovens-bakkerij-bakkerijtechniek.jpg" alt="Fast food concept" class="shadow-img" style="float:right; margin:0 0 10px 14px; width:180px; height:120px; object-fit:cover;" />
          <p style="text-align:justify;">Fast food is still a fast growing market. Finding the right concept, the choice between franchise or operate under its own management, are all questions that you answered best before starting a new business. Not every product is suitable for franchise! A good knowledge of the market linked to the production facilities can indicate what could be the most suitable solution for you.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="colored-box">
            <img src="/images/ovens-bakkerij.jpg" alt="Olive oil" class="shadow-img" style="width:100%; border-radius:2px; margin-bottom:8px;" />
            <p style="text-align:center; font-weight:700; font-size:12px;">OLIVE OIL</p>
            <p style="text-align:justify; font-size:12px;">Starting with the selection of the suitable olive, the quest for a decent supplier and the final packaging and selection of the most profitable sales-channel. We help you from A to Z. A few years ago we handled the introduction of ROZAKIS olive oil in OKAY supermarkets, part of COLRUYT, with success.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="clear:both;"></div>
      <div class="divider"></div>

      <div class="colored-box">
        <h5>PINSO HELPS YOU DEVELOPING NEW PRODUCTS FOR BAKERY, FAST FOOD AND DELICATESSEN</h5>
        <img src="/images/image002-3.jpg" alt="Bakery automation" class="shadow-img" style="float:right; margin:0 0 10px 14px; width:220px; height:140px; object-fit:cover;" />
        <p style="text-align:justify;">Leading a production requires already a lot of the production manager and his staff. This leaves little time in your search for new products or an additional service that can help your sales department to grow. Within your company the renewal or expansion of the range is a priority if you would like to sell more to your customer. After thorough analysis of your production, the research of possible additional investments based on HQ market analysis, we can provide you with information which can help you grow.</p>
        <div style="clear:both;"></div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <Sidebar lang="en" activePage="innovation" side="left" showLogo={true} />
  </div>
</Layout>
